    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s roots trace back to the 1762 colonial land grant authorized by the British Crown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queensbury%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Quaker families first settled Queensbury in the 1760s, clearing land and establishing farms before the Revolutionary War disrupted their peace.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
