        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queensbury%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After the war, Quakers returned in 1783 and the settlement was officially re‑established as the town of Queensbury in 1786.",
